On 11 July 2025 we had our Nikkah at the KTDC Gateway in Kumarakom, on the shore of Vembanad Lake. Two days later, on 13 July, we held the reception lunch at Kbees Durbar in Kodungallur.

Thank you to everyone who came and celebrated with us.
